OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day on Sunday and feeling
OL,6,Fvery warm in the sunny spells. Some
OL,7,Fpatchy cloud developing in the
OL,8,Fafternoon, but still plenty of
OL,9,Fsunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright evening across the
OL,12,Fregion, with sunny spells. Remaining
OL,13,Fdry overnight with clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping. Rather warm overnight, but
OL,15,Ffeeling fresher in rural spots.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FDry, with clear or sunny
OL,18,Fspells, cloud increasing across the
OL,19,Fwest at times making skies a little
OL,20,Fhazy. Feeling very warm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
