OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRather
OL,6,Fchangeable with sunny spells and
OL,7,Fshowers, these locally heavy and
OL,8,Fperhaps thundery on Tuesday. Turning
OL,9,Fsomewhat drier from Wednesday, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures returning closer to
OL,11,Faverage.
